    {
      "id": 234567,
      "name": "der andere Jan",
      "username": "der_andere_Jan",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/der_andere_jan/{size}/1881_2.png",
      "created_at": "2020-12-24T19:47:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>@deanjday</p>\n<p>Not really.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Often, it is as brief as 'these have a +1 on all attacks if condition x is met\". Sometimes, it is a more refined set of signature moves to better flesh out a character.</p>\n<p>Either way, the biggest difference versus Villains is,&nbsp;it all has to work based off their one status die, which is always used whatever they do (instead of rolling a power, quality and status - that's reserved for Heroes and fully fledged Villains)</p>",
